 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** $O(n)$ for energy computation and proximal operator, where $n$ is the number of voxels.
+- **Time Complexity:** $O(n)$ for energy computation and proximal operator, where $n$ is the number of voxels [G].
